# Scratch scripts from parallel QA agents (cursor / cowork / one-off seeding).
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS: on 2026-08-01 an untracked one-off dropped into scripts/ put
# `pnpm verify` in the red for work that had nothing to do with it, and every
# gate run after that had to be discounted by hand — which is exactly the kind
# of thing that later gets discounted when it IS real. biome.json sets
# `vcs.useIgnoreFile: true`, so an entry here takes the file out of the gate AND
# out of reach of a broad `git add` in one move.
#
# Convention: one-off scripts go in scripts/scratch/. Anything meant to survive
# gets a real name, a test, and a commit.
scripts/scratch/
scripts/bulk-cursor-pets-staging.mjs
